# FUNDA360 PRODUCT REQUIREMENTS DOCUMENT (PRD)

## Role

You are a Senior Product Manager with extensive experience designing enterprise SaaS platforms for education.

Your task is to produce the official Product Requirements Document (PRD) for Funda360.

Do NOT write code.

Do NOT write database schemas.

Do NOT write API documentation.

Focus entirely on the PRODUCT.

Write as though this document will guide developers, designers, testers, stakeholders, and executives throughout the entire lifecycle of the product.

The document should be suitable for enterprise software development and future version control in GitHub.

Write professionally in Markdown.

