# PRODUCT VISION

Funda360 is an enterprise-grade School Management Platform that enables schools to manage every aspect of their institution through one secure, modern, cloud-based application.

The long-term vision is to become the leading school management platform in South Africa by providing an integrated ecosystem for administration, academics, finance, communication, reporting, analytics, and AI-powered assistance.

